Volcengine voice catalog and previews

internal/voices/catalog.json and internal/voices/media.zip (voice names,
descriptions, avatars and official preview audio for the seed-tts-2.0 voices)
were captured from Volcengine's public voice gallery
(https://console.volcengine.com/ark/region:cn-beijing/experience/voice?model=doubao-seed-tts-2-0).
They belong to Beijing Volcano Engine Technology Co., Ltd. / ByteDance, are
not covered by the Apache License, and are included only so the voice picker
can show the voices offline.

Speech synthesis needs your own Volcengine speech API key with seed-tts-2.0
enabled.

